[38;2;255;248;220mNow I have a clear picture. Let me implement P5.6 Modding-lite. The architecture:[0m
[38;2;255;248;220m- game/systems/data.py has Content(data_dir=...) loading game/data/*.json  [0m
[38;2;255;248;220m- game/systems/world.py has World(data_dir=...) passing it to Content[0m
[38;2;255;248;220m- But game/engine/scenes.py → RunScene.init → World(...) has no data_dir parameter[0m
[38;2;255;248;220m- game/main.py → Game(args, ...) → Game.run_headless() → start_run() → RunScene(...) — no data_dir threading[0m
[38;2;255;248;220m[0m
[38;2;255;248;220mSo the implementation needs to thread data_dir through the whole chain, plus add mod merging.[0m
